## Overview
This PR adds a new documentation section for **ERIFY™ App Core** — the secure, scalable backbone of the ERIFY global ecosystem.  

It provides:
- Setup instructions for deploying ERIFY App Core with **Cloudflare Workers & Pages**.
- Integration notes for **Node.js/Express APIs** and **Python/FastAPI AI services**.
- CI/CD automation via **GitHub Actions**.
- Security practices aligned with **ERIFY 4PW** (Prosperity & Wealth) principles.

## Why
ERIFY App Core powers applications, integrations, and AI systems across the ERIFY brand.  
This guide ensures smooth onboarding for developers and contributors deploying within Cloudflare’s global edge network.

